{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trackLifecycle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"LifecycleObservation","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV4KindO","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/Kind"},{"text":"> = Set(LifecycleObservation.Kind.allCases), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"version","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = Bundle.main.infoDictionary?[\"CFBundleShortVersionString\"] as? String, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"versionStore","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VersionStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking12VersionStoreP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore"},{"text":" = FileVersionStore(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notificationCenter","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NotificationCenter","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials18NotificationCenterC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .default, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"file","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#file","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#fileID","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"function","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#line","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"column","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#column","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LifecycleObservation","preciseIdentifier":"s:17LifecycleTracking0A11ObservationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"kinds","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The kinds of event to track; every kind by default. Leaving one out doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stop the rest of the work: the version is still saved, and the records still made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable on backgrounding."}]}]},{"name":"version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The version the app runs at now; the bundle’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleShortVersionString"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" tracks neither installs nor updates, and saves nothing.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"versionStore","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the version is kept from one launch to the next; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore.defaultDirectory"},{"type":"text","text":" by default."}]}]},{"name":"notificationCenter","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the platform posts its lifecycle notifications; the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"center by default."}]}]},{"name":"file","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s file; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"fileID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s module and file name; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"function","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller’s enclosing declaration; leave it to its default."}]}]},{"name":"line","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s line; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"column","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The caller’s column; leave it to its default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The observation, which tracks until it is cancelled, finished or released.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is tracked until this is called. Call it as the app launches, such as in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"application delegate’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"text":", and keep what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As it starts, it compares "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":" with the one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"versionStore"},{"type":"text","text":" saved: none tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install, another an update, the same neither; it then saves "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version"},{"type":"text","text":". Then it tracks an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open, not from the background. After that, each transition tracks once, however many times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is reported:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, visionOS and Mac Catalyst: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s notifications. Entering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the background tracks "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded"},{"type":"text","text":", returning to the foreground"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened"},{"type":"text","text":" from the background, and terminating "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A scene-based app gets them once for the whole app, not per scene."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"watchOS: ","type":"text"},{"code":"WKApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"‘s, without termination, which watchOS doesn’t report.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"macOS: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s. Another app becoming active counts as the background, this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one becoming active again as the foreground."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Linux: no notifications; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()"},{"text":" tracks the termination.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Leaving the foreground, it also makes the tracker’s records durable: it waits for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker to write every record tracked so far to the tracker’s store, then calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the store’s "},{"code":"synchronize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". A delivery batched with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" sends what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is pending as it reads the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" record. A notification’s handler only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hands the transition on; the tracking, the version store and the store’s work run on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task of their own, never on the thread that posted it. Where the system suspends an app in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background (all but macOS and Mac Catalyst), the handler asks it for background time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"ProcessInfo.performExpiringActivity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), held until the records are durable. A termination’s records are made durable the same way, without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holding the main thread up: what the process doesn’t finish before it exits is what the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s documented loss window takes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It keeps no state outside what it returns. Two calls observe twice, so call it once per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"Trackers","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Trackers"],"name":"LifecycleTracking"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV17LifecycleTrackingE05trackC05kinds7version0G5Store18notificationCenter4file0K2ID8function4line6columnAD0C11ObservationVShyAP4KindOG_SSSgx20FoundationEssentials012NotificationJ0CS3SS2itAD07VersionH0RzlF","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker+TrackLifecycle.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/LifecycleTracking\/Tracker+TrackLifecycle.swift#L63"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"trackLifecycle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"kinds","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":